# One Runesword, untapped by Twiddle, used on two of Bot2's attackers in one turn: the second activation's effects are
# about the second creature, from the time the second resolved (CR 611.2c), so Llanowar Elves, pinged to death by the
# second target (Triskelion) after it, are exiled instead of dying (CR 614.1a), though Runesword already made such an
# effect that turn about the first target (Ornithopter). Bot1's Phyrexian Walker, pinged by the Triskelion between the two
# resolutions and Shocked to death later that turn, goes to the graveyard: its damage is from before the second began.
